WEBVTT

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:30.540
Fumi Manjome, 1st Grade, Sakura Class

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.430
You're always so quick to cry, Fumi-chan.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:50.430
Manjome

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:50.440
I'm getting home late tonight,
so don't worry about dinner.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:53.490
You just transferred and they're making
you work overtime already?

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:58.060
They're throwing me a party to celebrate
my return to the main branch.

00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:01.000
Wow, that's really kind of them.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.450
They're just looking for an excuse to drink.

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:06.680
I guess I'll be heading out for a bit then.

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:07.830
Head out?

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:08.410
Yup.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:10.670
I'm going to see an old friend.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:13.360
What about Chizu-chan? You're
leaving her home alone?

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:17.340
I'll be back before dinner. Besides,
I'm taking Fumi with me.

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.710
Fumi?

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:23.300
Today's her first day at school, sure
she's going to be OK by herself?

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:27.010
You know she doesn't want
her mother with her.

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:31.260
It'd be a different story if Chizu-chan
was offering to go.

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:33.810
<i>So her cousin's OK but no parents-</i>

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:35.220
Mothballs?

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:38.400
Did you forget to put it on the hanger?

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:41.430
I finally remembered to, last night.

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.790
It's just a little bit, it'll be fine.

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.620
No one will notice.

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:52.630
Are you really going back home tomorrow?

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:54.420
Yeah...

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.610
Can't you stay on vacation a little longer?

00:03:57.610 --> 00:04:01.020
This week... No, even just one day...

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:09.160
Sorry, I would if I could...

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:12.950
I should have never come back.

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:13.610
Hmm?

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:17.350
I should have never come back
to stupid Kamakura.

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:21.490
I didn't want to leave you, Chizu-chan.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:34.600
OK!

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:36.420
Achan, your lunch.

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:38.640
Thanks!

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:40.570
Oh, you don't need to be in such a hurry.

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:41.300
Huh?

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:43.970
Shinobu said he'll drive you to school.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:46.760
What? He did?

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:09.300
That school uniform looks
pretty good on you.

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:12.630
Yeah, not bad. I like it.

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:15.300
Cool it with the compliments and just
drop me off at Kamakura station.

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:18.180
Why? I'll take you to your school.

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:19.520
Just drop me off at the station.

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:21.930
It's no big deal. I'll take you to school and-

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:23.210
It's embarrassing!

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:27.940
You're only cute when you're sleeping.

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:38.150
Watch out for molesters on the train.

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:38.150
Shut up!

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:58.200
Kita-Kamakura - Fujigaya

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:02.970
I'm so sorry. Are you all right?

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:05.050
Yes.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:06.560
I'm so sorry!

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:07.440
It's OK.

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:00.260
That hurts!

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:03.510
Fujigaya Station

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:07.330
That was unfortunate.

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:10.320
Thank you for saving me from him.

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:13.700
You just need to give the train molesters
a good stomp on the foot.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:14.750
Right.

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:24.010
Well, I'm heading that way.

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:25.240
Oh, OK.

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:29.040
Thank you so much for your help today.

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:35.400
She's so tall and yet she was crying.

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:38.450
That's kinda cute.

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:48.810
Good morning, elder sister.

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:50.980
Oh, good morning.

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:52.200
Morning.

00:07:54.710 --> 00:07:57.310
Good morning, Sister.

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:59.640
Good morning to you two as well.

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:01.140
Good morning!

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:04.930
Good morning to you too, dear.

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:17.250
It sits atop a long, long path up a hill.

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:19.500
Fujigaya Girls Academy

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:22.550
Today's my first day in high school.

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:27.240
From today on, I'm a Fujigaya young lady!

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:32.390
Matsuoka Secondary School for Girls

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:36.760
I look forward to being in class together.

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:38.470
Thank you.

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:41.500
OK, next.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:47.600
Umm... "Banjome-san"?

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:51.360
Isn't that you?

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:52.180
Huh?

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:53.380
Ah...

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:56.240
Sorry, I wasn't paying attention.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:09:00.690
I'm Fumi Manjome. I went
to Mikasa Middle School.

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:03.340
I moved to Kamakura last month.

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:04.970
I look forward to our time together.

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:06.650
Great, thank you.

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:08.880
OK, next.

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:12.490
<i>Hi, I'm Yukiko Kashimura from
Onari Middle School.</i>

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:12.140
I'm Yoko Hon'atsugi.

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:13.780
<i>I look forward to this year.</i>

00:09:12.670 --> 00:09:13.760
Nice to meet you.

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:15.620
Great, thank you.

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:16.820
OK, next.

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:19.400
So,

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:21.600
find anyone?

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:23.080
Nope.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.790
Same goes for your left.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.570
It's hopeless.

00:09:26.570 --> 00:09:31.170
Geez... Nobody wants to
join the Drama Club!

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:34.470
Oh well. It'll just be the three of us again.

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:38.270
Manjome-san has an air about
her, wouldn't you say?

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:39.750
Huh? Who's that?

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:46.020
Oh, Manjome-san. She's so tall, huh?

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:49.000
The kind to add some elegance
to our all-girls school?

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:53.570
Manjome-san!

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.770
Do you remember my name?

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:59.840
Yoko Hon'atsugi-san?

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:02.280
Can this girl remember her lines or what?

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:03.370
Pardon?

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:06.780
There she goes again. She's not shy at all.

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:09.660
But isn't that one of Pon-chan's good points?

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:12.000
Have you decided on a club to join?

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:15.440
Oh, I'm not planning on joining a club.

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:16.620
Wrong answer!

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:19.720
You have to join a club in this school.

00:10:21.860 --> 00:10:23.390
Oh, you look scary.

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.260
Sorry, don't get angry.

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:29.940
Those two are my friends
from middle school.

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:32.960
The one with the fluffy-looking
hair is Miwa Motegi.

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:35.820
The one with the short hair next
to her is Misako Yasuda.

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:38.930
We're going to join the Drama Club.

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:41.230
Why don't you join too?

00:10:41.230 --> 00:10:42.030
Uh...

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:44.250
Looks like she asked her.

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:45.750
How will she respond?

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:50.530
Whoops, rejected.

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:54.090
Goodbye elegance.

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:56.220
Oh, she's staying the course.

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:57.990
Abort mission, Pon-chan!

00:10:57.990 --> 00:11:00.810
Oh, could she have actually...

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:03.210
Is she gonna join?

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:04.490
She said no.

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:07.360
Then what were you two talking about?

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:10.100
She said we could grab tea on the
way home from school, though.

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.520
What the heck...

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:14.630
Sometimes you come up with a different
strategy in the course of conversation.

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:17.570
She doesn't look like the type, though.

00:11:20.160 --> 00:11:22.060
I did it again.

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:25.730
Why do I have such a hard time saying no?

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:29.860
You're always so quick to cry, Fumi-chan.

00:11:42.950 --> 00:11:44.650
Hello, Okudaira residence.

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:46.250
What?

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:48.070
What?!

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:50.390
Wow, it's been ages!

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:53.070
Really? When?

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:59.020
First Year, Class Fuji

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:05.060
Kazu-chan, wanna go to
Espoir on the way home?

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:05.730
Sure.

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:07.330
Why, what's going on?

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:09.340
There's something I wanna
talk to you about.

00:12:09.340 --> 00:12:10.520
Oh yeah?

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:11.780
Let's go!

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:14.680
Okudaira-san?

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:15.440
Huh?

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:18.900
Akira Okudaira-san, right?

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:19.790
Yes...

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:21.090
What a lovely name.

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:23.070
Th-Thank you.

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:26.340
I'm Kyoko Ikumi.

00:12:26.900 --> 00:12:28.070
Nice to meet you.

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:31.730
She sounds like such a real high school girl!

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:34.320
She's been in the Fujigaya school
system since first grade?

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:35.310
Yeah.

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:39.570
She comes across so sexy...
Or, more like a princess, actually.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:42.190
You said her name is Kyoko Ikumi-chan?

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:44.320
Bring her to the house after
you get to know her better.

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:45.240
OK!

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:47.850
"A lovely name," huh?

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:51.290
Did she say stuff like "I bid you good
day" at the end of the day?

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:56.000
She didn't say that, but she gives
off a total princess vibe.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.960
Wow, Fujigaya sounds fancy.

00:12:58.370 --> 00:12:59.970
Sure you fit in?

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:02.480
I fit in... I think.

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:03.580
You think?

00:13:03.580 --> 00:13:07.630
There aren't many students who've
been there since first grade.

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:12.510
It may feel a bit lonely at first, but just
hang in there until you make friends.

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:13.720
Yeah.

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:17.000
Friends, huh?

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:20.680
There was that girl from this morning,
now that I think about it.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:24.720
I wonder if I'll see her again.

00:13:26.350 --> 00:13:28.560
Oh, they're here.

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:29.730
Do I have a visitor?

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:33.150
Hi. Oh, I've been waiting for you!

00:13:33.150 --> 00:13:35.730
Oh, the door's open, so just let yourself in.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.660
Guess not.

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:36.850
Mine?

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:38.160
Of course not.

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:41.630
She's here to see Achan and I.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:43.690
Huh? Me too?

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:47.160
Long time no see!

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:48.640
I know, it's been ages!

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:49.690
How have you been doing?

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:50.920
Oh, I'm getting along fine!

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.440
Achan...?

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:56.270
Huh?

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:04.820
What? That's weird.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:06.340
What's wrong?

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:07.780
I don't have any crayons.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.520
What? You forgot them?

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:11.500
The teacher is gonna be mad.

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:16.260
No, I left them at school yesterday
so I wouldn't forget.

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:19.160
The teacher said not to leave them here.

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:20.800
What? Really?

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:23.230
Where did you put them anyway?

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:25.340
I don't remember.

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:28.030
Achan, it's bad! Fumi-chan, she...!

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:30.420
Where?

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:31.630
In the hallway.

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.600
Achan, here!

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:35.760
Crayons

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:43.680
Achan!

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:51.230
Fumi-chan!

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:58.340
They'll be dry by the end of the
day, so stop in here again.

00:14:58.340 --> 00:15:01.210
We will. Thank you.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:03.230
Thank you.

00:15:14.210 --> 00:15:16.870
Are you mad, Achan?

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.270
I'm not mad.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:20.630
Again?

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:23.110
You're always so quick to cry, Fumi-chan.

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:24.600
Come on, let's go.

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:27.030
OK.

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:32.980
Since Fumi-chan and I lived close by,
we were inseparable.

00:15:33.760 --> 00:15:39.990
We thought we'd go to the same elementary
school and be together forever.

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:42.660
Manjome

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:45.000
She's going to be so sad.

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:49.220
I thought they might get to be in the
same class as second graders, too.

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:53.050
Yeah, but it worked out for the best.

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:56.110
We were going to have
to remodel this house.

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:57.610
Oh, is that so?

00:15:57.610 --> 00:16:00.130
They said it's as old as you are, Grandma.

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:03.010
I don't need to be remodeled yet.

00:16:04.070 --> 00:16:05.610
By the way, where's Fumi?

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.480
She's with Achan at the park.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:10.990
I swear, those two spend every
waking minute together.

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:14.270
It's all right. Today's her last day in town.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:21.590
I'll write you letters... I promise.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:22.890
OK.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:25.520
Write me too...

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:29.800
OK, I will, so stop crying.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:30.990
OK...

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:35.470
Seriously, you're always so
quick to cry, Fumi-chan.

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:39.550
I never wrote her letters,

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:43.210
and I never got any from
Fumi-chan, either.

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:54.530
What is it?

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:57.880
I was just thinking how you
don't look like yourself.

00:16:57.880 --> 00:16:58.630
Huh?

00:16:58.630 --> 00:16:59.530
I mean...

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.360
See how tall you are?

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:06.990
I was always the tall one between us too.

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:11.120
You're kinda flat, huh?

00:17:12.140 --> 00:17:13.740
Oh, there's that scary face of yours.

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:14.850
Is not.

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:17.870
No, it is. You looked scary.

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:25.400
Yeah, she's calmed down finally.

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:28.390
She introduced me to some
of her classmates.

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:33.000
Chizu-chan? She's upstairs talking to Fumi.

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:34.470
Do you want to say hi?

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:35.940
Sure?

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:39.780
What? You saw her this morning?

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.830
What are the odds of that?

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:45.670
Yeah, but she didn't recognize
me at all, of course.

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:48.410
Oh, but weren't you such close friends?

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:50.680
When we were little kids, sure.

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:53.040
But she didn't recognize me, so...

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:54.900
Yeah, that makes sense.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:59.470
It's been so many years.
You're both grown up now.

00:18:00.070 --> 00:18:02.420
She called me flat.

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:06.770
Yours may be small but they're perky.

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:09.010
You're always so blunt.

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:28.130
Chizu-chan! Can you come here for a sec?

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:30.000
You come too, Fumi-chan.

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:32.450
Congratulations on your wedding, Chizu-chan.

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:34.660
Wow, you got this for me?

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:37.170
Make sure to bring your husband next time.

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:39.110
I will! Thank you!

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:41.410
Come on, have a piece too, Fumi-chan.

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:50.020
Sorry.

00:18:52.390 --> 00:18:54.240
I'm off to school!

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:57.070
I was gonna drive her in today, too...

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:58.580
You don't have to go to college today?

00:18:58.580 --> 00:18:59.700
I'm taking the day off.

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:04.620
Geez, you're gonna be really busy
once you start job hunting.

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:06.280
That's not for a long time.

00:19:06.280 --> 00:19:09.430
You'll be surprised how fast it sneaks up on
you if you aren't taking things seriously.

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:13.400
Stop taking care of your younger sister
all the time and evaluate things.

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:16.600
It's only natural for a brother to
care for his younger sister!

00:19:17.770 --> 00:19:20.870
I'm more worried about you, to be honest.

00:20:11.970 --> 00:20:13.240
Fumi-chan!

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:17.890
Kamakura

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:21.990
It makes sense, huh?

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:25.790
She's my cousin

00:20:27.690 --> 00:20:29.270
and a girl.

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:33.820
Congratulations on your wedding, Chizu-chan.

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:32.500
It makes total sense.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.240
Fumi-cha-!

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:56.560
You're always so quick to cry, Fumi-chan.

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:09.820
And with that one line, ten years
leapt ahead, just like that.

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:14.900
Flower Tale

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:39.860
See you next time.
